HPX v1.11.0: preserve address-backed thread descriptions in async/fork
dispatch and avoid taking the address of the action invoker template.
Required when HPX_WITH_THREAD_DESCRIPTION_FULL=ON.

Base revision: c9b81b401fbe6ba4a0306feff71d18ef01c71b34
Apply from the dependency source root with git apply --check, then git apply.
Rebuild and reinstall that dependency after applying the patch.

